  "SubGoals": [],
  "Description": "The StepOver goal executes the current step without stepping into any called goals. It first checks if the debug mode is active by evaluating the \\%debugActive\\% variable. If \\%debugActive\\% is false, the goal returns immediately without performing any further actions. If it is true, it proceeds to write a command to the debug channel indicating that a step over action is being executed.",
